 go-ahead from management\""]], "tables": [[["Grammatical Role", "Structure", "Example"], ["Phrasal Verb", "Go ahead + and + verb", "\"Go ahead and start the meeting.\""], ["Phrasal Verb", "Go ahead + with + noun", "\"We'll go ahead with the original plan.\""], ["Interjection", "Standalone response", "\"May I ask something?\" \u2192 \"Go ahead!\""]]], "code_blocks": [], "meta_description": "Learn \"go ahead\" meaning, usage & examples with our complete guide. Master this essential English phrase for confident communication. Includes grammar, synonyms & common mistakes to avoid.", "meta_keywords": "go ahead", "og_image": "https://static-assets.prepcdn.com/content-management-system/usage_of_go_ahead_fe3b362a71.png", "js_rendered": true, "js_message": "Page appears to be rendered by a JavaScript framework; content may be incomplete.", "success": true, "error": ""}}